{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":250885,\"title\":\"Indiana Joai: Elephant Cemetary\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"Very loosely based on a true story of Thai adventurer/photographer Joai Bangchark. After fleeing animal poachers, Joai receives a necklace made of elephant tusk from a dying man in the forest. The necklace can apparently control the actions of elephants. Using the necklace, he must thwart a band of evil animal poachers and save a local village, with the help of the ghost of a baby elephant.\",\"poster\":null,\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":8.5,\"voteCount\":2,\"year\":2003,\"runtime\":80,\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Action\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"TH\",\"name\":\"Thailand\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Sarawooth Rakpradith\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":1286078,\"name\":\"Sarawooth Rakpradith\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1267614,\"name\":\"Billy Ogan\",\"character\":\"Joei Bangchark\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1Qj5cAqnZ7UV0N7MQBFfiTmjsQz.jpg\"},{\"id\":1286077,\"name\":\"Ramida Prapasanobon\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mZrWnKCIOdu64XxlkWjfsbChVek.jpg\"},{\"id\":554966,\"name\":\"Komgrich Yuttiyong\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1341417,\"name\":\"Alexander Rendell\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/AuXrHmmYdXnvBthOwWk1K24Kv44.jpg\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":1726,\"title\":\"Iron Man\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/78lPtwv72eTNqFW9COBYI0dWDJa.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cKvDv2LpwVEqbdXWoQl4XgGN6le.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After being held captive in an Afghan cave, billionaire engineer Tony Stark creates a unique weaponized suit of armor to fight evil.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1368337,\"title\":\"The Odyssey\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5rhTDKUhPYvpdQIijFIs5VoWsON.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/c7btGYblBnfAaw713WvFM0Kimc7.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Odysseus, the legendary King of Ithaca, embarks on a long and perilous journey home following the Trojan War. Throughout his voyage, he is forced to confront the whims of gods, mythological monsters, and trials that stretch both his cunning and his humanity to the breaking point.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Action\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1300968,\"title\":\"The Hunger Games: Sunrise on the Reaping\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nzIXSQNgYZwFOMrmv0d0I3ulvkM.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aqFZcr2dxSZ2UwWSo1WC6C0rwDf.jpg\",\"rating\":7.8,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Return to the world of Panem 24 years before Katniss Everdeen volunteers in her sister's place, commencing on the morning of the reaping of the 50th Hunger Games, also known as the Second Quarter Quell.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Action\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":969681,\"title\":\"Spider-Man: Brand New Day\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bjiS5ipwxb9JFy3XRRN4OAilSeX.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/subj7knTn4DeS6KS7qI66EQKe9i.jpg\",\"rating\":8.5,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Fighting crime full-time as Spider-Man in a world that doesn't remember him—and the pressure of seeing his old friends move on without him—sparks a change in Peter Parker he may not have the power to control. But that transformation might also be the only thing that can stop a shocking new threat to the city and those he loves - a powerful villain no one can even see.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Action\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":299534,\"title\":\"Avengers: Endgame\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jtDv3lCnST0fZRvdYFwR5CVwK2x.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7RyHsO4yDXtBv1zUU3mTpHeQ0d5.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After the devastating events of Avengers: Infinity War, the universe is in ruins due to the efforts of the Mad Titan, Thanos. With the help of remaining allies, the Avengers must assemble once more in order to undo Thanos' actions and restore order to the universe once and for all, no matter what consequences may be in store.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1148365,\"title\":\"Matchbox the Movie\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aHhHRz6nOpwkqJs5ASeRGAdK2dt.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jdJsnhHfkIi3J7jwfiCFT4gXNx5.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When a group of former childhood friends reconnect, their reunion takes a wild turn as they stumble upon a dangerous international plot—and must save the world.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Comedy\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":980431,\"title\":\"Avatar Aang: The Last Airbender\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3sgnSfNT27Bx5O5ukr7B26mhEQq.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ezbrL1dMymKQZw7mDEWa2ZTzN7d.jpg\",\"rating\":9,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Avatar Aang, the world's last Airbender, learns of an ancient power that could save his culture from extinction. With the help of his friends, he embarks on a global quest to find it before it falls into the wrong hands and threatens to upend the peace they sacrificed everything to achieve.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":12445,\"title\":\"Harry Potter and the Deathly Hallows: Part 2\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/c54HpQmuwXjHq2C9wmoACjxoom3.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cbcpDn6XJaIGoOil1bKuskU8ds4.jpg\",\"rating\":8.1,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Harry, Ron and Hermione continue their quest to vanquish the evil Voldemort once and for all. Just as things begin to look hopeless for the young wizards, Harry discovers a trio of magical objects that endow him with powers to rival Voldemort's formidable skills.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":278927,\"title\":\"The Jungle Book\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2Epx7F9X7DrFptn4seqn4mzBVks.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8oYykF1Qhrb8fC2qZqD71EzRywg.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After a threat from the tiger Shere Khan, Mowgli, a man-cub fostered by wolves, is forced to flee the jungle, and he embarks on a journey of self-discovery with the help of the panther, Bagheera, and the free-spirited bear, Baloo.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Family\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":462310,\"title\":\"The Wanderers: The Quest of The Demon Hunter\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zaN0r8Qe1fC9VirVwnfmX0yjF3j.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ncTrm4bUkMCV3IkWTCMtwJBZolk.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A hardened vampire hunter and a journalist travel to a village in Transylvania to investigate a mysterious event that happened in Zalesky Castle. The duo are guided by a young Romanian girl and joined by a Korean television reality show team as they attempt to untangle the community’s secrets.\",\"genres\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Horror\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":14211,\"title\":\"Prey\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tPmURKjF15srICbmAjpz36PmZlP.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rBOb3v35qgTXkNHkOW2UYiTZjPa.jpg\",\"rating\":5.8,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"An American family on holiday in Africa becomes lost in a game reserve and stalked by vicious killer lions.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Horror\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":10016,\"title\":\"Ghosts of Mars\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/i2zztssCIbahGES1fdfWFmDXian.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1loG5dSesKgwakjOET0Ll27jKgI.jpg\",\"rating\":5.1,\"year\":2001,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In 2176, a Martian police unit is sent to pick up a highly dangerous criminal at a remote mining post. Upon arrival, the cops find the post deserted and something far more dangerous than any criminal — the original inhabitants of Mars, hellbent on getting their planet back.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Horror\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"vFrd9K2TkEc\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"PBTBoUvvFnA\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"FRUJkYC_idw\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}